# Copy to .env and fill in real values before running `docker compose up`.
# See README.md for the full walkthrough. `.env` is git-ignored - never commit real keys.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LiteLLM proxy
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Root credential of the proxy: creates virtual keys and logs into the admin UI
# on http://localhost:4000/ui (user 'admin', this value as the password).
# Generate with: echo "sk-$(openssl rand -hex 24)"
# Keep it long and high-entropy: Ivy also uses a configured key as a literal
# blocklist entry in SensitiveDataOutputGuardrail, so a dictionary word here
# would block every AI response containing it.
LITELLM_MASTER_KEY=sk-local-master-key

# Generate once with: openssl rand -base64 32
# Encrypts provider credentials stored in Postgres by LiteLLM.
# Do NOT change this after you've added models via the UI/API - existing
# credentials become undecryptable and you'd have to re-add every model.
LITELLM_SALT_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Provider credentials - optional
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only needed if a model refers to a key as `api_key: os.environ/OPENAI_API_KEY`,
# which keeps the secret here instead of in litellm-config.yaml or the database.
# Leave these out entirely to paste provider keys into the admin UI instead;
# LiteLLM then encrypts them into Postgres, where `docker compose down -v`
# discards them along with every model.
#
# Only variables listed in compose.yml reach the container - for another
# provider, add a matching line to the `litellm` service's `environment` block.

# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Example of the two required values (do not use these)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LITELLM_MASTER_KEY=sk-7f3c1a9e42b8d05c6ae1f27b930d4c8ea55b1f6d3c027a94
# LITELLM_SALT_KEY=qU1sB7Xk0mZP4vYtLc9EwNfR2hJdG6aTz8QoI3rVbXs=
